Each lead gets scored 0–100 based on:

  Has verified email    → +35 points
  Has phone number      → +20 points
  Has website           → +15 points
  Rating (e.g. 4.5★)   → +10 points
  Source quality        → +8  points
  Business keywords     → +7  points
  Address completeness  → +5  points

Grade A = 75+   → definitely email these
Grade B = 55–74 → good leads, worth trying
Grade C = 35–54 → borderline, use judgment
Grade D = <35   → skip these